@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/execution-ready-neg#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# fixture_execution_ready_negative v1.3.0 (backlog_execution_ready v1.4.0, G155: every lineage declares or declines an opening profile, Lin_NoProfile does neither; v1.2.0 was backlog_execution_ready v1.3.0, G148: Lin_FrozenAnswered is frozen by a bypass a restart has answered; v1.1.0 was backlog_execution_ready v1.2.0, G115: the recording rule sets are part of the start question;
# v1.0.0 was backlog_execution_ready v1.0.0; an adopting project handover,
# lineage2-executed-without-backlog-stage). NEGATIVE: a minimal graph, not a SHACL-complete register.
# The start gate is positive: it passes only when the facts that must exist before work starts do exist.
#
#  Lin_Ready      five active outputs, items below        lineage READY
#    S_Groomed      Ready, criterion, concern claim, planned     READY (the one item that may start)
#    S_NoCriterion  no acceptance criterion                      NOT READY
#    S_NoConcern    no concern claim                             NOT READY
#    S_Unplanned    no PlanningEvent                             NOT READY
#    S_Proposed     state Proposed                               NOT READY
#  Lin_Waiting    Mission..Objective only, no item (the adopting project's Lineage_2 on 2026-10-06)   NOT READY, items examined: 0
#  Lin_Retracted  the Backlog output is retracted                                         NOT READY
#  Lin_Frozen     five active outputs, an item, frozen by an unanswered finding           NOT READY
ex:M a backlog:Mission .
ex:Lin_Ready a backlog:Lineage ; backlog:profileDeclinedReason "fixture" ; rdfs:label "Lin_Ready"@en ; backlog:lineageOrdinal 1 ; backlog:lineageArchived false ; backlog:adoptsRuleSet backlog:RS_StatusHistoryRecorded , backlog:RS_FlowPointsRecorded .
ex:O_Lin_Ready_Mission a backlog:StageOutput ; backlog:outputOfStage backlog:Stage_Mission ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lin_Ready ; backlog:closedAtCommit "c" ; backlog:hasStateDigest "dLin_ReadyMission" .
ex:O_Lin_Ready_Scope a backlog:StageOutput ; backlog:outputOfStage backlog:Stage_Scope ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lin_Ready ; backlog:consumesOutput ex:O_Lin_Ready_Mission ; backlog:closedAtCommit "c" ; backlog:hasStateDigest "dLin_ReadyScope" .
