<http://example.org/execution-ready-neg#> backlog:hasExpectedPolarity backlog:Polarity_Negative .

#  v1.1.0 (G115): the recording rule sets. Lin_Ready adopts both (so it stays READY). The three below each hold one Ready, groomed item.
#  Lin_Unrecorded  adopts neither, states no reason, no item has started   NOT READY (both rule sets named, adopted by: nobody)
#  Lin_Declined    adopts neither, states recordingRuleSetsDeclinedReason  READY
#  Lin_Underway    adopts neither, an item is already In Progress          READY (not retroactively blocked)
